  "description": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Initial Setup**: Set up a GlobalSettings Vue component with a two-layout system - desktop sidebar with navigation and mobile drawer for responsive design.\n\n2. **Component Structure**: Implemented navigation between 10 settings sections (General, AI Models, Agents, Chat Prompts, Plugins, Workspaces, Users, Scripts, OAuth, ENV Variables) with conditional content rendering.\n\n3. **Desktop Layout**: Created a persistent sidebar with navigation buttons, header section, and footer action buttons (Reload, Save, Export/Import) for larger screens.\n\n4. **Mobile Layout**: Developed a drawer-based navigation system with hamburger menu toggle, collapsible sidebar, and bottom action bar optimized for smaller screens.\n\n5. **Bug Fix**: Resolved drawer selection issue where clicking navigation items didn't update the active tab by replacing `v-model` binding with explicit `:checked` and `@change` handlers for proper reactive state updates.",
