      "summary": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Initial Request**: Transform the GlobalSettings view to be responsive and mobile-friendly with a collapsible sidebar that converts to a drawer on mobile devices.\n\n2. **Design Approach**: Implemented a dual-layout strategy using TailwindCSS breakpoints (`md:`) to display a full sidebar on desktop and a hamburger menu drawer on mobile.\n\n3. **Mobile Optimization**: Created icon-only buttons and compact footer actions for mobile screens, while maintaining full labels and detailed layouts on desktop.\n\n4. **Drawer Implementation**: Used DaisyUI's drawer component for mobile navigation that automatically closes when a tab is selected, improving user experience.\n\n5. **Result**: Delivered a fully responsive GlobalSettings component with proper breakpoint handling, improving usability across all device sizes while maintaining the original functionality.",
